  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aguadulce LNG Terminal and Power Plant, through Black &amp; Veatch Holding Company</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This feasibility study grant for Aguadulce LNG, S.A.S. in Colombia will support the development of a liquefied natural gas (LNG) import terminal and a gas-fired power plant to provide reliable electricity in southwestern and central Colombia. The project will offer commercial opportunities for a wide range of U.S. LNG technologies, equipment, and services.</narrative>
  </description>
